## 2. Walkthrough & Exam Drills

### Drill 1: Deploy Storage Provisioner (`01-provisioners/`)

1. **Deploy Local Path Provisioner**:

   ```bash
   {{ cka_lab_storage_classes_dir }}/01-provisioners/install-local-path-provisioner.sh
   kubectl get pods -n local-path-storage
   ```

### Drill 2: Apply StorageClasses & Dynamic PVC (`02-storage-classes/`)

1. **Deploy StorageClasses**:

   ```bash
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_storage_classes_dir }}/02-storage-classes/cka-lab-sc-retain.yaml
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_storage_classes_dir }}/02-storage-classes/cka-lab-sc-delete-wait.yaml
   kubectl get storageclass
   ```

1. **Create Dynamic PVC & Inspect Delayed Binding**:

   ```bash
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_storage_classes_dir }}/02-storage-classes/cka-lab-dynamic-pvc.yaml
   kubectl get pvc cka-lab-dynamic-pvc
   ```

1. **Create Consumer Pod & Verify Bound Phase**:

   ```bash
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_storage_classes_dir }}/02-storage-classes/cka-lab-consumer-pod.yaml
   kubectl wait --for=condition=Ready pod/cka-lab-storage-consumer --timeout=60s
   kubectl get pvc,pv
   ```

1. **Verify Volume Expansion**:

   ```bash
   kubectl patch pvc cka-lab-dynamic-pvc -p '{"spec":{"resources":{"requests":{"storage":"200Mi"}}}}'
   kubectl get pvc cka-lab-dynamic-pvc
   ```

